{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "hub_node",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83c\udfe5 MEDORA HEALTH DATABASE\n**Relational Architecture & Clinical Schema**\n*MySQL Engine: InnoDB | Charset: UTF8MB4*",
      "x": 350,
      "y": -180,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "patient_details_node",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udc64 patient_details `[Core Master]`\n---\n- **PatID** `INT AUTO_INCREMENT` **[PK]**\n- `PatName` VARCHAR(100)\n- `MobileNumber` VARCHAR(15)\n- `Address` TEXT\n- `Age` INT\n- `DOB` DATE\n- `Weight` DECIMAL(5,2)\n- `LoginID` VARCHAR(50) [UNIQUE]\n- `Password` VARCHAR(255) [SHA-256]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "doctor_catalog_node",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udc68\u200d\u2695\ufe0f doctor_catalog `[Master Catalog]`\n---\n- **DoctorID** `INT AUTO_INCREMENT` **[PK]**\n- `DoctorName` VARCHAR(100)\n- `Speciality` VARCHAR(100)\n- `YearsExperience` INT\n- `Qualification` VARCHAR(200)\n- `ContactNumber` VARCHAR(15)",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "tests_catalog_node",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83e\uddea tests_catalog `[Service Catalog]`\n---\n- **TestID** `INT AUTO_INCREMENT` **[PK]**\n- `TestName` VARCHAR(100)\n- `Category` VARCHAR(50)\n- `Price` DECIMAL(8,2)\n- `Description` TEXT",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "patient_doctor_assignment_node",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83e\udd1d patient_doctor_assignment `[Junction]`\n---\n- **AssignID** `INT AUTO_INCREMENT` **[PK]**\n- *PatID* `INT` **[FK -> patient_details]**\n- *DoctorID* `INT` **[FK -> doctor_catalog]**\n- `AssignDate` DATE\n- `Notes` TEXT\n*(ON DELETE CASCADE)*",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "tests_assigned_node",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udccb tests_assigned `[Junction]`\n---\n- **AssignID** `INT AUTO_INCREMENT` **[PK]**\n- *PatID* `INT` **[FK -> patient_details]**\n- *TestID* `INT` **[FK -> tests_catalog]**\n- `AssignDate` DATE\n- `Status` VARCHAR(20) [Pending|Done]\n- `Notes` TEXT\n*(ON DELETE CASCADE)*",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 430,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "blood_test_results_node",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udd2c blood_test_results `[Clinical Telemetry]`\n---\n- **ResultID** `INT AUTO_INCREMENT` **[PK]**\n- *PatID* `INT` **[FK -> patient_details]**\n- `TestDate` DATE\n- **CBC**: `RBC`, `WBC`, `Platelets`, `Haemoglobin`, `TLC`\n- **DLC**: `Neutrophils`, `Lymphocytes`, `Eosinophils`, `Basophils`, `Monocytes`\n*(ON DELETE CASCADE)*",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 430,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "admin_users_node",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udd10 admin_users `[System Administration]`\n---\n- **AdminID** `INT AUTO_INCREMENT` **[PK]**\n- `Username` VARCHAR(50) [UNIQUE]\n- `Password` VARCHAR(255) [SHA-256]\n- `FullName` VARCHAR(100)\n- `Role` VARCHAR(50) [SuperAdmin]",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "1"
    }
  ],
